{"version":1,"content":"<p>前港姐李明慧與富商丈夫陳燿陽並育有龍鳳胎子女，雙方早前離婚，因19歲患有自閉症（SEN）的長子Jordan照顧與私隱問題各執一詞，女兒Ava則發千字聲明力撐母親，強調保護哥哥是她與母親一生的首要任務，絕不會因為權勢或輿論而停止發聲。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.328348+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:01:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:17:54.242019+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"5ca6a4e99defeba0b27925b1e96238904f61bd4adc8839baea0bbf62a3189a7a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}